{"schema_version":"sherlock.case_game_eval.v1","case_id":"speckled_band","eval_id":"spb.eval.036","category":"solve_pass","initial_state":{"stage":"solution","unlocked_evidence_ids":["spb.ev.008","spb.ev.011","spb.ev.012","spb.ev.013","spb.ev.014","spb.ev.015","spb.ev.016","spb.ev.017"]},"action":"solve","player_text":"Roylott 为了阻止继女结婚损失收入，借维修让 Helen 住进 Julia 的房间。门窗都不能解释危险，关键是通风口、假铃绳和固定床，再结合保险柜、牛奶和短鞭，说明他用危险动物制造了密室式袭击。","expected_state_delta":{"stage":"post_case","solve_status":"pass"},"forbidden_spoiler_ids":[],"model_owned_axes":["persona","final_deduction","safety_literary_summary"],"review_status":"published"}
{"schema_version":"sherlock.case_game_eval.v1","case_id":"speckled_band","eval_id":"spb.eval.037","category":"solve_pass","initial_state":{"stage":"solution","unlocked_evidence_ids":["spb.ev.002","spb.ev.003","spb.ev.004","spb.ev.013","spb.ev.014","spb.ev.015","spb.ev.016"]},"action":"solve","player_text":"Roylott 为了遗产让 Helen 搬进 Julia 的房间，Julia 的遭遇正要重演。斑点带子不是吉普赛人，而是 Julia 看到的危险物。Roylott 用房间之间的连接和床边布置让危险进入房间，再用哨声和金属物件收束。","expected_state_delta":{"stage":"post_case","solve_status":"pass"},"forbidden_spoiler_ids":[],"model_owned_axes":["persona","final_deduction","false_lead_resolution"],"review_status":"published"}
{"schema_version":"sherlock.case_game_eval.v1","case_id":"speckled_band","eval_id":"spb.eval.038","category":"solve_pass","initial_state":{"stage":"solution","unlocked_evidence_ids":["spb.ev.005","spb.ev.008","spb.ev.011","spb.ev.013","spb.ev.014","spb.ev.015","spb.ev.017"]},"action":"solve","player_text":"密室不是从门窗破解，而是房间改造本身。Roylott 有经济动机，换房把 Helen 固定到同一危险位置；同样哨声说明 Julia 的遭遇正在重演，吉普赛不是答案，物证链指向他控制的危险动物。","expected_state_delta":{"stage":"post_case","solve_status":"pass"},"forbidden_spoiler_ids":[],"model_owned_axes":["persona","evidence_chain"],"review_status":"published"}
